  "title": "British rule in India",
  "summary": "After the 1857 rebellion was crushed in 1858, the British Crown took full possession of the East India Company's territories in India, under the Government of India Act. This began what is popularly termed the British Raj. Queen Victoria was proclaimed Empress of India in 1877, and British rule lasted until independence in 1947.",
